\u0101 laik\u0101 palielin\u0101t komandas biedru vietu skaitu komandas dal\u012bbas period\u0101. Dodieties uz \\"Iestat\u012bjumi\\" - \\"Biedri\\" un noklik\u0161\u0137iniet uz \\"Papla\u0161in\u0101t\\".","team_answer_5_content_3":"Pievienot papildu biedru vietu izmaksas = 199 cilv\u0113kam/gadam \xf7 365 dienas \xd7 pievienoto biedru vietu skaits \xd7 atliku\u0161o dienu skaits.","team_answer_5_content_4":"Samazin\u0101t biedru vietu skaitu.","team_answer_5_content_5":"J\u016bs varat sazin\u0101ties ar mums jebkur\u0101 laik\u0101, kam\u0113r j\u016bsu komandas dal\u012bbnieku dal\u012bbas termi\u0146\u0161 ir sp\u0113k\u0101, lai samazin\u0101tu komandas dal\u012bbnieku skaitu. Dal\u012bbnieku skaita samazin\u0101\u0161anas izmaksas tiks p\u0101rveidotas par dien\u0101m un izmantotas, lai pagarin\u0101tu j\u016bsu komandas dal\u012bbas termi\u0146u.","team_answer_5_content_6":"Pagarin\u0101tie biedru dienas = Samazin\u0101to neizmantoto vietu izmaksas \xf7 Dienas cena \xf7 Atliku\u0161\u0101s vietas.","team_answer_5_content_7":"L\u016bdzu, nor\u0101diet savas samazin\u0101t\u0101s s\u0113dvietu pras\u012bbas sada\u013c\u0101 \\"Pal\u012bdz\u012bba un atsauksmes\\", un m\u0113s nekav\u0113joties sekosim l\u012bdzi un apstr\u0101d\u0101sim j\u016bsu piepras\u012bjumu.","team_faq_7":"Vai ir iesp\u0113jams izsniegt r\u0113\u0137inu?","team_answer_7_content_1":"P\u0113c veiksm\u012bgas pas\u016bt\u012bjuma apmaksas, ja nepiecie\u0161ams izrakst\u012bt r\u0113\u0137inu, j\u016bs varat atlas\u012bt \\"R\u0113\u0137ins\\" \\"Iestat\u012bjumi\\" - \\"Komandas\\" - \\"R\u0113\u0137inu\\" lap\u0101, aizpild\u012bt r\u0113\u0137ina inform\u0101ciju un izrakst\u012bt r\u0113\u0137inu.","team_faq_6":"Vai es varu pieteikties atgrie\u0161anai naud\u0101 p\u0113c komandas dal\u012bbnieku statusa uzlabo\u0161anas?","team_answer_6_content_1":"P\u0113c veiksm\u012bgas maks\u0101\u0161anas j\u016bs varat sazin\u0101ties ar mums un piepras\u012bt naudas atgrie\u0161anu 30 dienu laik\u0101 p\u0113c maks\u0101juma veik\u0161anas.","team_answer_6_content_2":"L\u016bdzu, aprakstiet savu atgrie\u0161anas piepras\u012bjumu sada\u013c\u0101 \\"Pal\u012bdz\u012bba un atsauksmes\\", un m\u0113s sekojam l\u012bdzi un \u0101tri rea\u0123\u0113jam.","team_answer_6_content_3":"Atgrie\u0161anas nor\u0101d\u012bjumi:","team_answer_6_content_4":"Ja jums izdodas atsaukt abon\u0113\u0161anu, jums joproj\u0101m b\u016bs j\u0101maks\u0101 par izmantoto pakalpojumu (apr\u0113\u0137in\u0101ts, pamatojoties uz izmantoto dienu skaitu).","team_answer_6_content_5":"Par neizmantotajiem servisa maks\u0101jumiem, apstiprin\u0101t\u0101 atmaks\u0101 tiks atgriezti j\u016bsu maks\u0101jumu kont\u0101 7 darba dienu laik\u0101. L\u016bdzu p\u0101rbaudiet to uzman\u012bgi.","team_answer_6_content_6":"Lai izvair\u012btos no neskaidr\u012bb\u0101m, atmaksa netiek piem\u0113rota komandas papla\u0161in\u0101\u0161anas pas\u016bt\u012bjumiem.","setting_team_member":"Dal\u012bbnieki","team_file_over_size":"Maksim\u0101lais faila izm\u0113rs ir 50MB.","current_member_seats":"Pa\u0161reiz\u0113jais biedru s\u0113dvietu skaits.","item_list_quantity":"Saraksta daudzums.","item_team_shared_list_quantity":"Komandas koplietotais sarakstu skaits.","item_number_of_tasks_per_list":"Uzdevumu skaits katr\u0101 sarakst\u0101.","item_number_of_check_items_per_task":"Kie\u0161u kiek punkt\u0173 skiripto kie\u017ei kie\u017ei","item_number_of_reminders_per_task":"Uzdevumam pieejamo atg\u0101din\u0101jumu skaits.","item_numbr_upload_attachment":"Katram cilv\u0113kam/dien\u0101 var aug\u0161upiel\u0101d\u0113t pielikumu skaits.","item_task_duration":"Uzdevuma ilgums","item_priority_task":"Priorit\u0101tes uzdevums.","item_task_nesting":"Uzdevumu iegult\u012b\u0161ana","item_recurring_task":"Atk\u0101rtojo\u0161s uzdevums.","item_check_items_reminders":"Patsingsaideeri atsaukti","item_tag":"Mar\u0137\u0113\u0161anas p\u0101rvald\u012bba.","item_list_view":"Saraksta skats","item_kanban_view":"Kanbana 